The following method is a correct implementation of the insertion sort algorithm. The method correctly sorts the
elements of  numList  so that they appear in order from least to greatest.

public static void insertionSort(ArrayList<Integer> numList)
{
   for (int j = 1; j < numList.size(); j++)
   {
      int temp = numList.get(j);
      int k = j;
      while (k > 0 && temp < numList.get(k - 1))
      {
         numList.set(k, numList.get(k - 1));
         k--;
      }
      numList.set(k, temp);
      /* end of outer loop */
   }
}

